---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Leow Kah Man Tech Blog"
  description="Privacy disclosures regarding cookies, Google Analytics 4, and Google AdSense compliance."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose-tech py-6">
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Effective date: November 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy governs the manner in which <strong>www.leowkahman.com</strong> ("the Website", "we", "us") collects, uses, maintains, and discloses information collected from users of this website.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Static Architecture &amp; Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      The Website is hosted as a static site on GitHub Pages. We do not operate user accounts, databases, registration portals, or comment submission systems. We do not collect or store personal identity data directly.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to serve advertisements when you visit our website. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the internet.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</h2>
    <p>
      We utilize Google Analytics 4 to collect aggregated, anonymous telemetry regarding site visits, page interactions, and device characteristics. This telemetry enables us to understand which articles deliver value to engineering readers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our Google Analytics 4 implementation operates with strict privacy protections:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>IP Anonymization</strong> is enabled by default in GA4.</li>
      <li><strong>Restricted Data Processing</strong> and Google Signals are disabled by default.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of Google Analytics tracking across all websites by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. First-Party Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
      The Website does not set first-party cookies, session trackers, or persist tokens in browser <code>localStorage</code>. All functional content delivery is completely static.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Rights Under GDPR &amp; CCPA</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your jurisdiction (such as the European Economic Area, United Kingdom, or California), you retain statutory rights regarding data protection, including rights to access, rectification, or erasure of any telemetry data processed by third-party analytics providers.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Contact Regarding Privacy Inquiries</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or data processing on this Website, you may contact the site operator directly via <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kmleow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
